physics: Cycle 891 checker cache + receipt (10/10 gates PASS, 577s, 7/7 teeth)

Full independent recomputation of B=4 and B=5 with an interval-algebra detector
reproduces the primary's episode spectra, complement sets, incidence tables and
co-occurrence counts row for row, and agrees with the pinned Cycle-889 receipt.
The rule recomputed from its STATED TEXT alone reproduces both holdout
predictions and both carrier maps; the seal-time build log contains no holdout
tier.  The k-run law survives 2553 attack cells outside the observed family with
0 mismatches while the +1 perturbation breaks on all 381 control cells.  All
four B=7 witness anatomies verified register by register, with the controller's
own token shuffle as a second, independent tick generator.
findings_the_primary_did_not_report: EMPTY.

